                                                                                                                                                                                                        
 Usage: spec-kitty [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
 Setup tool for Spec Kitty spec-driven development projects.                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
 Set SPEC_KITTY_NO_UPGRADE_CHECK=1 to disable the upgrade-check notice.                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --version             -v        Show version and exit                                                                                                                                                │
│ --install-completion            Install completion for the current shell.                                                                                                                            │
│ --show-completion               Show completion for the current shell, to copy it or customize the installation.                                                                                     │
│ --help                -h        Show this message and exit.                                                                                                                                          │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ accept              Validate mission readiness before merging to main.                                                                                                                               │
│ agent               Commands for AI agents to execute spec-kitty mission actions programmatically                                                                                                    │
│ archive             Archive a terminal mission (operator-invoked only).                                                                                                                              │
│ charter             Charter management commands                                                                                                                                                      │
│ config              Display project configuration and asset resolution information.                                                                                                                  │
│ consolidate         Consolidate a lane-based mission into its target branch.                                                                                                                         │
│ context             Query workspace context information                                                                                                                                              │
│ cutover-guard       Diff-scoped fail-closed cut-over gate (pre-merge required check).                                                                                                                │
│ dispatch            Dispatch a request to a governed Op (canonical surface).                                                                                                                         │
│ docs                Common Docs retrieval commands                                                                                                                                                   │
│ doctor              Project health diagnostics                                                                                                                                                       │
│ events              Event log tailing commands                                                                                                                                                       │
│ glossary            Glossary management commands                                                                                                                                                     │
│ implement           Internal — allocate or reuse the lane worktree for a work package.                                                                                                               │
│ init                Initialize a new Spec Kitty project.                                                                                                                                             │
│ intake              Ingest a plan document as a mission brief for /spec-kitty.specify.                                                                                                               │
│ invocations         Query local invocation records.                                                                                                                                                  │
│ issue-matrix        Issue-matrix commands (structured issue-matrix.json).                                                                                                                            │
│ lint                Run ruff and mypy on a file and report errors.                                                                                                                                   │
│ materialize         Regenerate all derived views from the canonical event log.                                                                                                                       │
│ migrate             Migration commands: update .kittify/ layout and backfill identity fields in legacy missions.                                                                                     │
│ mission             Inspect mission types for this project.                                                                                                                                          │
│ mission-type        Inspect mission types for this project.                                                                                                                                          │
│ next                Decide and emit the next agent action for the current mission.                                                                                                                   │
│ ops                 Operation history (git reflog)                                                                                                                                                   │
│ orchestrator-api    Machine-contract API for external orchestrators (JSON-first)                                                                                                                     │
│ plan                Scaffold plan.md for a Mission.                                                                                                                                                  │
│ plugin              Plugin bundle commands                                                                                                                                                           │
│ profile-invocation  Manage invocation records.                                                                                                                                                       │
│ profiles            Manage and list agent profiles.                                                                                                                                                  │
│ reconcile           Reconcile a mission dossier against its recorded snapshot (exit 0=parity, non-zero=divergence).                                                                                  │
│ regen               Regenerate the committed generated agent-command + skill fixtures from source (#3447).                                                                                           │
│ research            Scaffold research artifacts from the mission type's shipped templates.                                                                                                           │
│ retrospect          Retrospective authoring and summary (create / backfill / summary)                                                                                                                │
│ review              Validate a merged mission: WP lane check, dead-code scan, BLE001 audit.                                                                                                          │
│ safe-commit         Commit only the requested files via Spec Kitty's safe-commit path.                                                                                                               │
│ session-start       Emit spec-kitty orientation for the Claude Code SessionStart hook.                                                                                                               │
│ session-stop        Emit the open-Ops reminder for the Claude Code Stop hook.                                                                                                                        │
│ spec-commit         Commit spec artifacts to the mission's resolved placement.                                                                                                                       │
│ specify             Create a feature scaffold in kitty-specs/.                                                                                                                                       │
│ tasks               Finalize tasks metadata after task generation.                                                                                                                                   │
│ tracker             Task tracker commands                                                                                                                                                            │
│ upgrade             Upgrade a Spec Kitty project to the current version.                                                                                                                             │
│ validate-encoding   Validate and optionally fix file encoding in feature artifacts.                                                                                                                  │
│ validate-tasks      LEGACY: Validate and repair directory/frontmatter lane mismatches.                                                                                                               │
│ verify-setup        Verify that the current environment matches Spec Kitty expectations.                                                                                                             │
│ workflow            Manage mission workflow definitions                                                                                                                                              │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

